# Agent worktrees: each is a full checkout of this repo on some other branch,
# so committing them would commit a second copy of the project. Only this
# directory, not all of `.claude/` — the rest of it is checked in on purpose.
# `vite.config.ts` excludes the same path from the test glob, for the related
# reason that vitest would otherwise run a second suite from another branch.
.claude/worktrees/
